  "job_B3.2.23_20251003_114622": {
    "text": "Mine gebro\u00f0ru \u00f0a leofestan, ge sculon to so\u00f0on \u00f0is witan, hwanon w\u00e6re ongunnen \u00e6rest \u00feeos bisne, \u00fe\u00e6t\nSo\u00f0lice \u00fea \u00f0a ure Drihten, \u00fee is \u00e6lmihtig God, gesceop \u00feone forman man Adam, he gesceop hine ealne\nSeo halignis & rihtwisnis & seo undeadlicnis didon Adam habban Godes silfes anlicnysse & gelicnesse.\nAnd for\u00f0an cw\u00e6\u00f0 God \u00e6r\u00f0am he gesceope Adam: Uton wircan man to ure anlicnisse & gelicnisse; \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd \u00feas his anlicnesse us bebead Drihten to habbenne \u00fea \u00f0a he cw\u00e6\u00f0 on his godspelle, Estote sancti,\nEornostlice for\u00f0an \u00fee God gesceop Adam swa godne & swa haligne, we r\u00e6da\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he asende hine into\nSo\u00felice on \u00f0am ilcan neorxnawange him forgeaf Drihten ealne wuldor.\n\u00d0\u00e6r he geseah englas & wi\u00f0 hig spr\u00e6ce, & n\u00e6fre he ne swulte, gif he ne singode.\n\u00d0\u00e6r he gehyrde Drihten silfne wi\u00f0 hine sprecende & him bebodende swilce gehirsumnisse \u00fe\u00e6t he\nAc \u00fea on \u00f0\u00e6re ylcan tide \u00fee Adam \u00feis br\u00e6c & wi\u00f0 God singode, \u00fea adraf hine Drihten, \u00fee is bisceop\nAc hw\u00e6t dide Adam si\u00f0\u00f0an he w\u00e6s adr\u00e6fed of neorxnawange?\nGewislice he dide swy\u00f0e lange d\u00e6dbote geond syx hundred geara f\u00e6c & \u00feonne gyt mare.\n\u00c6t nyhstan \u00e6fter his for\u00f0si\u00fee he w\u00e6s asend on hellicne cweartern, \u00fe\u00e6r he lange tyd heofode &\nAnd swa lange he w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6r besargiende & behreowsiende, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ure Drihten H\u00e6lend Crist, se \u00f0e is\nEornostlice, gebro\u00feru mine \u00fea leofestan, we bisceopas beo\u00f0 ures Drihtenes H\u00e6lendes Cristes speliendas\n& for\u00f0an us geaf Drihten \u00e6fter \u00feam apostolum anweald manna sawla to bindenne & to unbindenne &\nSo\u00f0lice \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0 Drihten \u00feurh Hieremian his witegan to \u00e6lcum bisceope: Efne ic gesette \u00fee ofer\nUnderstanda\u00f0, leofan men, mid godum wyllan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t we eow willa\u00f0 secgan.\nFor\u00f0on sende God \u00e6lmihtig Adam into neorxnawange, \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00f0am ylcan neorxnawange wurdon\nAnd gewislice swa hig diden gyf Adam ne agylte.\nMine gebro\u00f0ru, \u00fea ylcan bisne ures Drihtenes H\u00e6lendes Cristes we biscopas habba\u00f0 on circan, & \u00fea\nWitodlice, swa swa Godes sunu l\u00e6dde Adam haligne & rihtwisne into neorxnawange, swa eac we &\nForhwan l\u00e6de we \u00fe\u00e6ge men on cyrcan \u00fee \u00e6r w\u00e6ron towordene halige \u00feurh fulluht buton for\u00f0am ylcan\nSwa eac we sacerdos for\u00f0on l\u00e6da\u00f0 gefullode men into circan, \u00fe\u00e6t hig on \u00e6lcne tyman wircon on \u00fe\u00e6re\nGod \u00e6lmihtig gesette Adame \u00e6 \u00fe\u00e6ge he sceolde healdan \u00feurh gehyrsumnysse.\nHwilce \u00e6, buton \u00fe\u00e6t he ne \u00e6te of \u00f0am treowe ingehydes godes & ifeles?\nSwa eac God gesett eow \u00f0urh us \u00e6 \u00fe\u00e6ge ge sculon healdan on cyrcan.\nHwilce \u00e6 gesett eow Drihten to healdenne \u00feurh us, \u00fe\u00e6t is, \u00feurh ure mynegunge?\nWitodlice \u00feas \u00e6 he gesett eow to healdenne on \u00f0are he \u00f0u cw\u00e6\u00f0: Ne ofsleh \u00feu.\nNe unrihth\u00e6me \u00f0u.\nNe stel \u00f0u.\nNe sege \u00feu lease gewytnisse.\nNe swera \u00feu man.\nLufa \u00feinne Drihten God of ealre \u00feinre heortan, & lufa \u00f0inne nehstan swa swa \u00f0e sylfne.\nLeofan men, \u00feas bebodu ealle eow gesette Drihten \u00feurh us, \u00fe\u00e6t ge hig healdon & wyrcon \u00feurh\nAc hw\u00e6t dide Drihten be Adame for\u00f0on \u00fee he ne heold \u00fea gehyrsumnysse?\nGewislice he adraf hine ut of neorxnawange, wepende & heofigende & swy\u00f0e unrotsiende.\nSwa eac we biscopas adr\u00e6fa\u00f0 eow ut of Godes circan, for\u00f0on \u00f0e ge ne healda\u00fe \u00fea gehyrsumnysse\n\u00dea \u00f0a he adraf hine of neorxnawange, \u00fea he \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0: In sudore uultus tui uesceris pane tuo; \u00fe\u00e6t is:\nAc hw\u00e6t dide Adam si\u00f0\u00f0an he w\u00e6s adr\u00e6fed of neorxnawange?\nGewislice he dide mycele d\u00e6dbote to \u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re wyr\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t hine God eft onfenge into\nAnd ge ealswa \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee we truwia\u00f0 didon d\u00e6dbote on \u00feyssum lengtenf\u00e6stene \u00fe\u00e6t ge beon wyr\u00f0e in to\n\u00d0\u00e6t ge sculon swa\u00feeah witan \u00fe\u00e6t swa swa se eadiga Ambrosius cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t nan bisceop ne m\u00e6g\nAnd for\u00f0on we secga\u00f0 eow \u00f0is, \u00fe\u00e6t gyf ge nabba\u00f0 git swylce behreowsunge gedon \u00fee Gode lycie, \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd gyf ge ne magon f\u00e6stan, ge magon huru don \u00e6lmissan seo alyse eowre sawla of helle.\n\u00d0\u00e6t ge sculon eac understandan, \u00fe\u00e6t ge n\u00e6fre na mare ne don on eowre d\u00e6dbote buton swa mycel\nAc \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re d\u00e6dbote ge moten be eowrum agenum wyllan mare don, swa swa didon \u00fea halgan \u00fee\nMine gebro\u00f0ru, efne nu is Adam eft underfangen on \u00feam heofenlican neorxnawange for \u00f0\u00e6re myclan\nAnd ge, Gode \u00feanc, nu tod\u00e6g beo\u00f0 eft underfangene on cyrcan swylce into neorxnawange for eowre\nAnd nu for\u00f0on \u00fee ge on \u00feissum d\u00e6ge hider samod comon to onfonne eft \u00fe\u00e6re halgan cyrcan\n\u00d0\u00e6t eow geunne se mildheorta Drihten, \u00fee leofa\u00f0 & rixa\u00f0 on ealra worulda woruld, amen.",
